Scope. This licence covers the source code and documents written for MetaCodex:
unity/Assets/MetaCodex (except its Fonts folder), unity/Assets/Plugins/Android/*.java,
userland/ (our scripts, Core v0 and build tools; except userland/agent-skills),
native/, tools/, tests/, local-ai/server, docs/ (except docs/licenses/ and
docs/diagrams/fonts/, which hold third-party texts and fonts), and our changes
to MQH. It does NOT cover the third-party material that is in this repository
or that the app ships or downloads: Unity-made files (unity/Assets/TextMesh Pro,
unity/Assets/Settings, unity/Assets/XR, unity/Assets/CompositionLayers,
unity/Assets/Scenes/SampleScene.unity, unity/Assets/InputSystem_Actions.inputactions),
Meta SDK settings files (unity/Assets/Oculus, unity/Assets/Resources/*Settings*.asset,
OVRBuildConfig.asset), the binaries in unity/Assets/Plugins (proot, talloc,
libandroid-shmem, MoonSharp), all fonts, userland/agent-skills, and the icons
under mqh/plugins/*/icons. Each of them stays under its own licence. The Meta XR
SDK, the Unity engine, the Linux image (Debian), the local AI runtime and the AI
models are not in this repository; they are fetched or built separately, under
their own licences. Everything is listed, with licence, source and obligations,
in docs/LICENSES.md; the licence texts are in docs/licenses/.
